Package: platform-security-patrol
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Platform Security Patrol Tool
 A tool for detecting and enabling hardware-level security capabilities
 on domestic CPUs (Hygon, etc.) and operating systems.
 .
 Features:
  - Unified capability modeling
  - Intelligent decision engine
  - Automatic detection and evaluation
  - Plugin-based architecture
  - Three-layer judgment mechanism (CPU/Firmware/OS)
